00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:08.650
for which it stands. One

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:09.690
nation

00:01:12.525 --> 00:01:13.485
indivisible

00:01:13.565 --> 00:01:15.085
with liberty

00:01:15.085 --> 00:01:16.685
and justice for all.

00:01:17.325 --> 00:01:18.285
Now

00:01:18.285 --> 00:01:20.125
we can move to public speak.

00:01:21.085 --> 00:01:24.925
>> Okay public speak and there are a lot of people on here

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:35.190
