the Board of Education is well within

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.170
appropriateness to be asking to meet the contractual needs.

00:06:53.235 --> 00:06:53.875
Understand that

00:06:54.275 --> 00:07:11.140
people think that classrooms can be cut, but I think when people reference class size and they're talking about how back in the day classes were larger, they're forgetting that these days education is completely different. The state requires a lot more, there's a lot more testing.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:25.175
I think that when we're looking at class size, you need to take into account how many special ed kids there might be in the class and like with kindergarten, how many of them were not pre K that makes a very big difference.

00:07:25.735 --> 00:07:30.135
I think when we're talking about class size, you really need to think about

00:07:30.615 --> 00:07:39.080
how it's different these days. And one of the big draws to Andover is their school system. I know my family along with a lot of other families

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.160
