00:08:02.565 --> 00:08:03.525
And

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:07.410
we need to keep that because it continues to draw families into town.

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:08.690
Thank you.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:12.450
