00:08:18.135 --> 00:08:26.695
>> Thanks, Amanda. So yeah, just real quick. I appreciate the challenge that the board of finance has, and I really hope we can come to

00:08:27.095 --> 00:08:32.910
something that's passable by the community. We all did swear an oath when we joined our relative

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:43.765
boards to serve those constituencies which we're supposed to serve. And so I agree, I think the board of education has done its due diligence in trying to get the budget to where it needs.

00:08:44.245 --> 00:08:53.845
