00:08:54.405 --> 00:08:56.085
several other members of the community, but

00:08:56.880 --> 00:09:02.160
we would love to support the seniors in the senior center. As a matter of fact, I even asked Sherri Holmes,

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:17.285
our finance director, if we were allowed to even start a GoFundMe because I know I would be willing to put money into a fund to help move the senior citizens center along as best as we could. And so I'm certainly supportive of the senior center

00:09:17.445 --> 00:09:18.085
and

00:09:18.485 --> 00:09:23.205
hope that we can reach an agreement. And I do wanna touch on the class size.

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:28.460
The previous speaker said that there's a different world and yes, it absolutely is.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:34.060
When most of us were educated, prior to about 1995,

00:09:34.540 --> 00:10:02.910
