00:19:09.125 --> 00:19:11.205
This has been a long four months,

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:14.530
five months, and we all want it to be over.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:19.330
We also support the seniors, and I am really tired

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:22.450
of the divisiveness in this town between

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:25.730
pitting the parents and the school against the seniors.

00:19:26.645 --> 00:19:29.845
