00:19:30.245 --> 00:19:31.525
I have always

00:19:31.605 --> 00:19:33.125
supported seniors,

00:19:33.205 --> 00:19:34.565
senior projects,

00:19:34.885 --> 00:19:37.845
and many other things in this town other than the school.

00:19:38.405 --> 00:19:40.085
So please don't suggest

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.770
that simply by advocating,

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:45.090
not bullying, thank you very much,

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:46.450
advocating

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.690
for the Board of Education budget

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:51.490
that we are dismissing seniors

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.490
and not taking into account seniors.

00:19:54.745 --> 00:19:58.745
If the community center had been my project for the last ten years.

00:19:59.865 --> 00:20:02.905
Maybe I would have been more advocacy oriented for that.

00:20:03.385 --> 00:20:06.825
My project for the last six years has been on the board of education.

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:09.270
I've taken it very seriously.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:11.110
I've put in a lot of time.

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:14.150
Please listen to our superintendent.

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:16.790
Please listen to the town's

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:17.990
finance director.

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:20.390
We no longer have a school budget manager.

00:20:21.065 --> 00:20:22.825
We have an impartial

00:20:22.825 --> 00:20:28.345
Town Finance Director who last Wednesday told you that she was concerned

00:20:28.425 --> 00:20:37.540
about her ability to pay the school's bills next year with the budget that you passed last Tuesday, excuse me, last Wednesday.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.300
Thank you very much for your time, Board of Finance.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:45.460
I hope not to take up any more of your time in the coming weeks.

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:46.900
Let's get a budget passed.

00:20:49.235 --> 00:20:50.275
Thanks, Shannon.

