00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:06.550
Very passionate about our town,

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:08.310
passionate about our seniors,

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:10.310
passionate about our

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:11.750
school children,

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:14.390
