00:25:53.010 --> 00:25:55.410
So the enrollment for kindergarten

00:25:55.810 --> 00:25:59.650
that we now know of, it could still increase even more,

00:26:00.130 --> 00:26:02.210
as Jerry said earlier,

00:26:02.450 --> 00:26:03.810
is 38 students,

00:26:04.695 --> 00:26:07.815
