00:26:17.880 --> 00:26:20.280
Thank you, Jed. Anything else? My

00:26:20.280 --> 00:26:21.880
>> only last comment is

00:26:22.120 --> 00:26:25.800
that as a senior, I don't necessarily view

00:26:26.040 --> 00:26:28.280
the budget debate is a

00:26:28.775 --> 00:26:31.335
