00:27:30.395 --> 00:27:31.595
And I'm sure many

00:27:31.675 --> 00:27:37.435
children could learn in large class sizes, but many children would not and would be left behind.

00:27:38.620 --> 00:27:39.420
I know,

00:27:39.740 --> 00:27:47.020
you know, at Ram Middle School and High School, the class sizes are about the same as what Andover has in their classes.

00:27:47.420 --> 00:27:49.820
So, know, moving forward onto

00:27:50.055 --> 00:27:56.935
the middle school and high school, it's not like these kids should be overwhelmed at all. They're very similar in the class sizes.

00:27:58.375 --> 00:28:03.255
You know, we're a community, we need to come together. We need to realize that nothing comes for free.

00:28:04.000 --> 00:28:08.960
There's a large group of us that would be willing to pay an increase in mill rate and

00:28:09.280 --> 00:28:10.240
the overall

00:28:11.360 --> 00:28:12.240
taxes.

00:28:12.240 --> 00:28:12.720
So,

00:28:15.120 --> 00:28:17.520
you know, I'm in favor of the increase of

00:28:17.965 --> 00:28:19.085
the 97,000

00:28:19.085 --> 00:28:22.685
to meet the contractual needs for the board of ed.

00:28:23.405 --> 00:28:26.605
And, you know, I'm also in favor of

00:28:28.285 --> 00:28:35.090
what Jed just said as well. You know, this town needs more going for it. I think that's all. Thank you.

00:28:39.330 --> 00:28:40.450
Thanks, Melissa.

00:28:40.690 --> 00:28:42.530
Next up, Kelly Howell. Hello.

00:28:46.530 --> 00:28:54.155
>> Was, I'm joining tonight, I wanted to just touch base on a couple of things and make a couple of comments. I would like to first of all request that

00:28:54.395 --> 00:28:55.755
the board of finance

00:28:56.235 --> 00:28:57.675
meet the board of education

00:28:57.835 --> 00:28:59.515
with that $97,000

00:28:59.515 --> 00:29:00.155
request

00:29:00.450 --> 00:29:07.650
to cover the obligations for this school year and to be able to move forward and not have to keep doing these meetings every week

00:29:08.610 --> 00:29:22.455
for the twenty one-twenty two school year. But I would also like to request that because there are a lot of concerns within the town of maybe where money is being spent and whatnot, that I don't know if a committee can be formed like a subcommittee through the Board of Finance

00:29:22.695 --> 00:29:26.615
to maybe begin looking now at the twenty two-twenty three

00:29:27.540 --> 00:29:40.580
school year options as far as what can be combined, what can't be combined, etcetera, so that we're not next June in the same position we're in right now, that we've had an entire year to kind of look at what our options are. And maybe there's options to do

00:29:41.365 --> 00:29:42.565
some regionalization

00:29:42.565 --> 00:29:46.805
with Region eight to combine some of our services to help

00:29:47.125 --> 00:29:52.165
cut some of the costs, not only for our school, but for our town as well. So I wanted to kind of throw that out there.

00:29:52.485 --> 00:30:02.230
And then also, I want to just kind of also address that class size that a lot of people seem to be concerned about because it's hard to tell if people are concerned about the AES budget

00:30:02.310 --> 00:30:06.310
because of that class size or if they're just looking to cut a certain amount of money.

00:30:06.710 --> 00:30:16.515
Because if you look at larger districts that have larger class sizes, they also have a full time BCBA in the school. They have a full time psychologist, a full time school psychologist,

00:30:16.595 --> 00:30:18.275
a full time special ed director.

00:30:18.595 --> 00:30:20.195
We don't have that at AES.

00:30:20.275 --> 00:30:21.795
So if we're gonna consider

00:30:22.430 --> 00:30:25.630
increasing our class sizes and eliminating

00:30:25.630 --> 00:30:29.950
these small classes, then we need to consider what's more cost effective.

00:30:30.270 --> 00:30:33.790
In actuality, it's more cost effective to have smaller classes

00:30:34.190 --> 00:30:40.425
than to pay for all of those services. So I guess the question is, what do we want more? Smaller class sizes,

00:30:40.905 --> 00:30:45.305
but saving a little bit of money or spending more money and having those additional services

00:30:45.385 --> 00:30:48.105
full time within our school to support those larger classes?

00:30:48.920 --> 00:30:50.040
Thank you very much.

00:30:51.240 --> 00:30:52.120
Thanks,

00:30:52.120 --> 00:30:52.760
Kelly.

