>> I just wanted to say that I am in support of restoring the 97,000

00:36:08.375 --> 00:36:10.375
for the Board of Education.

00:36:11.335 --> 00:36:14.855
I also wanted to express that, you know, we're in a pandemic,

00:36:15.335 --> 00:36:18.180
so it's obvious that education

00:36:18.180 --> 00:36:20.340
in a pandemic comes at a cost.

00:36:21.060 --> 00:36:24.900
Our little town of Andover has been highlighted for the success of

00:36:25.860 --> 00:36:26.820
educating

00:36:26.820 --> 00:36:28.500
full time in a pandemic.

00:36:28.660 --> 00:36:30.340
I work across the state

00:36:30.995 --> 00:36:34.915
in the town of Fairfield. They have not the first time they really got to school was

00:36:35.475 --> 00:36:37.475
probably in the springtime. So,

00:36:37.795 --> 00:36:49.530
you know, to punish our students and, you know, and take away when they're there, mask on every day in a pandemic, it just doesn't make sense. And history has told us that in a time of tragedy,

00:36:49.690 --> 00:36:51.930
we need to come together, not divide.

00:36:52.490 --> 00:36:53.130
And

